<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><title>SecureShield Antivirus | Protect Your Digital World</title><meta name="description" content="Discover antivirus protection for your devices. Explore security features, plans, and online safety tips."><style>* {    margin: 0;    padding: 0;    box-sizing: border-box;}:root {    --primary: #5145e5;    --dark: #10152b;    --light: #f5f7ff;    --text: #5d6477;}body {    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;    color: var(--dark);    line-height: 1.6;}a {    text-decoration: none;    color: inherit;}button, .btn {    cursor: pointer;    border: none;    display: inline-block;    border-radius: 8px;    padding: 13px 22px;    font-size: 15px;    font-weight: bold;    transition: .2s;}.btn-primary {    background: var(--primary);    color: white;}.btn-primary:hover {    background: #392dc2;    transform: translateY(-2px);}.btn-outline {    border: 1px solid #d9dcef;    color: var(--dark);    background: white;}header {    padding: 18px 7%;    display: flex;    align-items: center;    justify-content: space-between;    background: white;    position: sticky;    top: 0;    z-index: 10;    box-shadow: 0 2px 15px #10152b0b;}.logo {    font-size: 23px;    font-weight: 800;    color: var(--primary);}nav {    display: flex;    align-items: center;    gap: 28px;}nav a {    font-size: 14px;    font-weight: 600;}nav a:hover {    color: var(--primary);}.menu-toggle {    display: none;    background: var(--light);    color: var(--dark);}.hero {    background: linear-gradient(130deg, #f0f1ff, #ffffff 65%, #e6f8ff);    padding: 90px 7%;    display: grid;    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr .9fr;    gap: 55px;    align-items: center;}.tag {    display: inline-block;    background: #e6e4ff;    color: var(--primary);    padding: 7px 14px;    border-radius: 30px;    font-size: 12px;    font-weight: bold;    margin-bottom: 20px;}h1 {    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 61px);    line-height: 1.12;    letter-spacing: -2px;    margin-bottom: 23px;}h1 span {    color: var(--primary);}.hero p {    color: var(--text);    max-width: 510px;    font-size: 17px;    margin-bottom: 27px;}.hero-buttons {    display: flex;    gap: 12px;    flex-wrap: wrap;}.trust {    margin-top: 25px;    color: var(--text);    font-size: 13px;}.security-card {    background: white;    border-radius: 24px;    padding: 35px;    box-shadow: 0 25px 80px #3330a018;    text-align: center;    border: 1px solid #ededf7;}.shield {    width: 145px;    height: 165px;    margin: 0 auto 25px;    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #7166ff, #392dc2);    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 94% 16%, 89% 65%, 72% 86%, 50% 100%, 28% 86%, 11% 65%, 6% 16%);    display: flex;    align-items: center;    justify-content: center;    color: white;    font-size: 65px;}.security-card h2 {    font-size: 23px;    margin-bottom: 8px;}.security-card p {    font-size: 14px;    margin: 0 auto;}section {    padding: 80px 7%;}.section-heading {    text-align: center;    max-width: 650px;    margin: 0 auto 45px;}.section-heading h2 {    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);    line-height: 1.2;    margin-bottom: 15px;}.section-heading p {    color: var(--text);}.features {    display: grid;    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);    gap: 22px;}.feature {    padding: 28px;    border: 1px solid #e9eaf3;    border-radius: 16px;    background: white;    transition: .2s;}.feature:hover {    transform: translateY(-5px);    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px #1517350b;}.feature-icon {    width: 53px;    height: 53px;    border-radius: 13px;    background: #eeedff;    display: grid;    place-items: center;    font-size: 26px;    margin-bottom: 20px;}.feature h3 {    margin-bottom: 10px;    font-size: 19px;}.feature p {    color: var(--text);    font-size: 14px;}.why {    background: var(--light);}.plans {    display: grid;    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);    gap: 22px;    align-items: stretch;}.plan {    border: 1px solid #e6e7f1;    border-radius: 18px;    padding: 30px;    background: white;}.plan.popular {    border: 2px solid var(--primary);    box-shadow: 0 15px 40px #5145e518;}.plan-label {    color: var(--primary);    font-size: 12px;    font-weight: bold;    text-transform: uppercase;}.plan h3 {    font-size: 22px;    margin: 12px 0;}.price {    font-size: 36px;    font-weight: 800;    margin-bottom: 5px;}.price small {    font-size: 13px;    font-weight: normal;    color: var(--text);}.plan p {    font-size: 14px;    color: var(--text);    margin-bottom: 20px;}.plan ul {    list-style: none;    margin: 22px 0;}.plan li {    padding: 8px 0;    font-size: 14px;}.plan li::before {    content: "? ";    color: #179b69;    font-weight: bold;}.plan .btn {    width: 100%;    text-align: center;}.faq-list {    max-width: 800px;    margin: auto;}details {    padding: 20px;    border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e8f1;}summary {    cursor: pointer;    font-weight: bold;}details p {    margin-top: 12px;    color: var(--text);}.cta {    text-align: center;    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #5145e5, #28208f);    color: white;    padding: 65px 7%;}.cta h2 {    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);    margin-bottom: 15px;}.cta p {    margin-bottom: 25px;    color: #e0dfff;}.cta .btn {    background: white;    color: var(--primary);}footer {    background: #10152b;    color: white;    padding: 35px 7%;    text-align: center;}footer p {    color: #b6bbcf;    font-size: 13px;    margin-top: 12px;}footer a {    margin: 0 9px;    font-size: 13px;}@media (max-width: 850px) {    .hero {        grid-template-columns: 1fr;        padding-top: 60px;    }    .security-card {        max-width: 480px;        width: 100%;        margin: auto;    }    .features, .plans {        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);    }    nav {        gap: 15px;    }}@media (max-width: 600px) {    header {        padding: 15px 5%;        flex-wrap: wrap;    }    .menu-toggle {        display: block;    }    nav {        display: none;        width: 100%;        flex-direction: column;        align-items: flex-start;        padding-top: 20px;    }    nav.open {        display: flex;    }    .hero, section {        padding: 55px 5%;    }    .features, .plans {        grid-template-columns: 1fr;    }    .hero-buttons .btn {        width: 100%;        text-align: center;    }    .security-card {        padding: 25px;    }}</style></head><body><header>    <a href="#" class="logo">?? SecureShield</a>    <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle"            aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNav">        ? Menu    </button>    <nav id="mainNav">        <a href="#home">Home</a>        <a href="#features">Features</a>        <a href="#plans">Plans</a>        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>        <a href="#plans" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Plans</a>    </nav></header><main><section class="hero" id="home">    <div>        <span class="tag">YOUR DIGITAL SAFETY STARTS HERE</span>        <h1>Stay Safe.<br>Browse <span>Confidently.</span></h1>        <p>            Discover smarter ways to protect your digital life.            Explore security features designed to help you learn about            malware protection, online privacy and safer browsing.        </p>        <div class="hero-buttons">            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Features ?</a>            <a href="#plans" class="btn btn-outline">View Plans</a>        </div>        <div class="trust">            ? Security education &nbsp; ? Privacy awareness        </div>    </div>    <div class="security-card">        <div class="shield">?</div>        <h2>Your Security Matters</h2>        <p>            Learn about antivirus protection and practical            ways to keep your devices safer online.        </p>    </div></section><section id="features">    <div class="section-heading">        <h2>Powerful Security Features</h2>        <p>            Understand the essential features to look for            when choosing antivirus software.        </p>    </div>    <div class="features">        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Malware Protection</h3>            <p>Learn how antivirus tools help identify viruses,               malicious files and other digital threats.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Safer Browsing</h3>            <p>Explore ways to recognize suspicious websites,               phishing links and unsafe downloads.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Privacy Awareness</h3>            <p>Discover practical steps for protecting your               personal information and online accounts.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">?</div>            <h3>Performance</h3>            <p>Compare antivirus tools for system compatibility,               resource usage and everyday performance.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Security Updates</h3>            <p>Understand why current software and regularly               updated threat definitions matter.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Device Compatibility</h3>            <p>Check whether a security product supports your               operating system and devices.</p>        </article>    </div></section><section class="why">    <div class="section-heading">        <h2>Choose the Right Protection</h2>        <p>            Every device and user has different needs.            Compare features before selecting a security product.        </p>    </div>    <div class="features">        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Know Your Needs</h3>            <p>Consider browsing habits, work requirements and               the devices you use every day.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">??</div>            <h3>Compare Costs</h3>            <p>Review subscription terms, renewal prices and               the features included in each plan.</p>        </article>        <article class="feature">            <div class="feature-icon">?</div>            <h3>Review Carefully</h3>            <p>Read independent product reviews and verify               compatibility before making a purchase.</p>        </article>    </div></section><section id="plans">    <div class="section-heading">        <h2>Explore Security Plans</h2>        <p>            Example pricing cards for your website.            Replace these sample prices and features with your real offers.        </p>    </div>    <div class="plans">        <article class="plan">            <span class="plan-label">Basic</span>            <h3>Essential</h3>            <div class="price">Free <small>/ example</small></div>            <p>For users exploring basic security options.</p>            <ul>                <li>Security education resources</li>                <li>Online safety guidance</li>                <li>Product comparison</li>            </ul>            <a href="#faq" class="btn btn-outline">Learn More</a>        </article>        <article class="plan popular">            <span class="plan-label">Popular Choice</span>            <h3>Advanced</h3>            <div class="price">?499 <small>/ example month</small></div>            <p>Sample pricing for a premium security offering.</p>            <ul>                <li>Features depend on selected product</li>                <li>Compatibility information</li>                <li>Plan comparison guidance</li>            </ul>            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Enquire Now</a>        </article>        <article class="plan">            <span class="plan-label">For Multiple Devices</span>            <h3>Family</h3>            <div class="price">?999 <small>/ example month</small></div>            <p>Example plan for users comparing multiple devices.</p>            <ul>                <li>Multi-device plan comparison</li>                <li>Device compatibility guidance</li>                <li>Security tips for families</li>            </ul>            <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Enquire Now</a>        </article>    </div></section><section id="faq" class="why">    <div class="section-heading">        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>        <p>Helpful information about antivirus software.</p>    </div>    <div class="faq-list">        <details>            <summary>What is antivirus software?</summary>            <p>Antivirus software helps detect, block and remove               certain malicious software. The protection provided               depends on the product and its configuration.</p>        </details>        <details>            <summary>Do I need antivirus protection?</summary>            <p>Security needs vary by device and operating system.               Keep your software updated, use strong passwords,               and review the security features already available               on your device.</p>        </details>        <details>            <summary>Can I download antivirus software here?</summary>            <p>This template is an informational website and does               not include antivirus software. Only download               security products from their verified official sources.</p>        </details>        <details>            <summary>Will this website scan my computer?</summary>            <p>No. This page is a website template and does not               scan your device, detect threats or install software.</p>        </details>    </div></section><section class="cta" id="contact">    <h2>Make Online Safety a Priority</h2>    <p>Explore your options and choose protection that fits your needs.</p>    <a href="#features" class="btn">Explore Security Features ?</a></section></main><footer>    <a href="#home" class="logo">?? SecureShield</a>    <p>        Informational website template. No antivirus protection,        scanning or software downloads are provided by this page.    </p>    <p>© <span id="year"></span> SecureShield. Replace with your business details.</p>    <p>        <a href="#home">Home</a>        <a href="#features">Features</a>        <a href="#plans">Plans</a>        <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>    </p></footer><script>const menuToggle = document.getElementById("menuToggle");const mainNav = document.getElementById("mainNav");menuToggle.addEventListener("click", function () {    const isOpen = mainNav.classList.toggle("open");    menuToggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(isOpen));});mainNav.querySelectorAll("a").forEach(function (link) {    link.addEventListener("click", function () {        mainNav.classList.remove("open");        menuToggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");    });});document.getElementById("year").textContent =    new Date().getFullYear();</script></body></html>